WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.090 --> 00:00:01.170
- Hi, I'm Dylan Sprouse.

00:00:01.170 --> 00:00:03.150
I play Trevor in "After We Collided,"

00:00:03.150 --> 00:00:05.760
which is coming soon to U.S. theaters.

00:00:05.760 --> 00:00:08.263
And today I'm going to
be taking a BuzzFeed quiz

00:00:08.263 --> 00:00:10.650
on which Sprouse twin I really am.

00:00:10.650 --> 00:00:12.740
Maybe, maybe what my soul is.

00:00:12.740 --> 00:00:13.866
I hope I get Dylan.

00:00:13.866 --> 00:00:16.449
(upbeat music)

00:00:17.570 --> 00:00:18.740
- First things first,

00:00:18.740 --> 00:00:21.390
pick another set of
iconic twins to hang with.

00:00:21.390 --> 00:00:24.740
Mary Kate and Ashley Olsen,
Tia and Tamera Mowry,

00:00:24.740 --> 00:00:28.403
Joel and Benji Madden,
Aaron and Shawn Ashmore.

00:00:28.403 --> 00:00:31.100
I think I would go with Tia and Tamera,

00:00:31.100 --> 00:00:33.380
I've met them and they just seem

00:00:33.380 --> 00:00:34.840
like a blast to hang out with.

00:00:34.840 --> 00:00:36.600
So those are the two I would pick.

00:00:36.600 --> 00:00:38.680
Select a Disney series DVD

00:00:38.680 --> 00:00:40.470
to bring with you to a deserted Island.

00:00:40.470 --> 00:00:41.804
The Suite Life of Zack and Cody,

00:00:41.804 --> 00:00:45.040
Wizards of Waverly place, Hannah Montana,

00:00:45.040 --> 00:00:46.366
and That's So Raven.

00:00:46.366 --> 00:00:47.710
Hmm.

00:00:47.710 --> 00:00:48.840
Wow, that's tough.

00:00:48.840 --> 00:00:52.410
I think I would probably, I
know it sounds silly to say,

00:00:52.410 --> 00:00:54.720
but I think I would
actually do The Suite Life,

00:00:54.720 --> 00:00:58.920
only because if I was on a
deserted island it would...

00:00:58.920 --> 00:01:01.350
It would fill me with
joy to see my friends

00:01:01.350 --> 00:01:04.200
and family in those episodes together.

00:01:04.200 --> 00:01:05.810
It would remind me to keep

00:01:05.810 --> 00:01:08.550
on hanging in there in
the deserted Island.

00:01:08.550 --> 00:01:12.060
Choose a Sprouse role,
you know, for funsies.

00:01:12.060 --> 00:01:14.000
Julian McGrath from Big Daddy,

00:01:14.000 --> 00:01:15.660
Nick from Banana Split,

00:01:15.660 --> 00:01:18.060
Billy or Bobby from That '70s Show,

00:01:18.060 --> 00:01:20.010
Trevor from After We Collided,

00:01:20.010 --> 00:01:24.180
Ben Geller from Friends, Will
Newman from Five Feet Apart.

00:01:24.180 --> 00:01:27.370
Hmm, who would I choose?

00:01:27.370 --> 00:01:28.350
That's a good one.

00:01:28.350 --> 00:01:30.420
I would do Julian McGrath from Big Daddy.

00:01:30.420 --> 00:01:32.090
A lot of fun memories there.

00:01:32.090 --> 00:01:35.020
I get to relive my six year
old experience in New York

00:01:35.020 --> 00:01:35.930
for the first time.

00:01:35.930 --> 00:01:36.763
That would be fun.

00:01:36.763 --> 00:01:38.400
That looks like Cole there.

00:01:38.400 --> 00:01:39.233
You can always tell

00:01:39.233 --> 00:01:43.200
because he's got very
large two front teeth.

00:01:43.200 --> 00:01:45.740
My teeth, since I was a rowdy little lad,

00:01:45.740 --> 00:01:49.970
we're chipped in places
and, I was very scrappy.

00:01:49.970 --> 00:01:51.670
That's definitely Cole there.

00:01:51.670 --> 00:01:53.740
Look at it his angelic little smile.

00:01:53.740 --> 00:01:55.320
Wow, what an angel.

00:01:55.320 --> 00:01:57.910
Choose a dynamic duo to snack on.

00:01:57.910 --> 00:02:00.870
Peanut butter and jelly, bacon and eggs,

00:02:00.870 --> 00:02:03.761
spaghetti and meatballs,
cheese and crackers.

00:02:03.761 --> 00:02:05.890
I'm a big PB and J guy.

00:02:05.890 --> 00:02:06.890
It's my favorite.

00:02:06.890 --> 00:02:08.881
That's either between that or the BLT.

00:02:08.881 --> 00:02:10.960
So I'm going to do
peanut butter and jelly,

00:02:10.960 --> 00:02:12.300
and I'm going to do like one of those

00:02:12.300 --> 00:02:14.960
artisanal thick peanut butters

00:02:14.960 --> 00:02:16.990
and a nice strawberry jelly.

00:02:16.990 --> 00:02:18.770
And then I cut the crust off

00:02:18.770 --> 00:02:20.430
because I'm an artist

00:02:20.430 --> 00:02:22.970
and I'll eat that on potato bread.

00:02:22.970 --> 00:02:25.320
Pick a Tipton regular to live with.

00:02:25.320 --> 00:02:27.340
Mr. Moseby, London Tipton,

00:02:27.340 --> 00:02:29.498
Maddie Fitzpatrick, Arwin Hawkhauser.

00:02:29.498 --> 00:02:30.660
(laughing)

00:02:30.660 --> 00:02:31.690
- Oh my gosh.

00:02:31.690 --> 00:02:34.380
Geez, I love the photos that
you picked for this too.

00:02:34.380 --> 00:02:36.710
If I had to pick a regular to live with,

00:02:36.710 --> 00:02:37.980
I'd pick London Tipton,

00:02:37.980 --> 00:02:40.310
I mean, she's got the
run of the Tipton Hotel.

00:02:40.310 --> 00:02:41.630
So I'd either do that

00:02:41.630 --> 00:02:44.602
or I would pick Arwin
Hawkhauser because Arwin,

00:02:44.602 --> 00:02:48.630
in the show, always was making
these really cool gadgets

00:02:48.630 --> 00:02:49.911
that we would play around with.

00:02:49.911 --> 00:02:52.120
So it's one of those two,

00:02:52.120 --> 00:02:53.320
I picked Awrin.

00:02:53.320 --> 00:02:55.120
Pick a hobby to take up in your twenties.

00:02:55.120 --> 00:02:57.960
Narrative podcasting,
Polaroid photography,

00:02:57.960 --> 00:03:00.750
brewing artisanal alcohols,
writing comic books.

00:03:00.750 --> 00:03:02.060
Wow, I don't know.

00:03:02.060 --> 00:03:02.910
That's tough.

00:03:02.910 --> 00:03:05.354
I would probably say
brewing artisanal alcohols.

00:03:05.354 --> 00:03:08.120
That just sounds like
something a wizard would do.

00:03:08.120 --> 00:03:10.360
Finally, choose a Riverdale plot line

00:03:10.360 --> 00:03:12.053
that sounds fake but is totally real.

00:03:12.053 --> 00:03:14.045
(laughing)

00:03:14.045 --> 00:03:15.550
- Oh, Cole would love this.

00:03:15.550 --> 00:03:18.430
When Betty found out she
had the serial killer gene,

00:03:18.430 --> 00:03:20.570
when Archie got mauled by a bear,

00:03:20.570 --> 00:03:21.887
when Jughead delivered his,

00:03:21.887 --> 00:03:24.610
"I'm a weirdo" speech out of the blue,

00:03:24.610 --> 00:03:27.760
when Cheryl waterboarded
her mother with maple syrup,

00:03:27.760 --> 00:03:28.782
oh god.

00:03:28.782 --> 00:03:29.615
(laughing)

00:03:29.615 --> 00:03:32.486
- When Edgar Evernever
and his organ-harvesting

00:03:32.486 --> 00:03:34.584
cult joined the fold,

00:03:34.584 --> 00:03:36.933
when Veronica ran an
underground speakeasy.

00:03:38.170 --> 00:03:40.220
Well I was actually in Vancouver

00:03:40.220 --> 00:03:42.180
when Archie got mauled by a bear,

00:03:42.180 --> 00:03:44.110
it was really funny to be there for that.

00:03:44.110 --> 00:03:47.080
But when Cheryl waterboarded her mother

00:03:47.080 --> 00:03:50.602
with maple syrup is the
most extremely bizarre

00:03:50.602 --> 00:03:52.360
thing I've ever read.

00:03:52.360 --> 00:03:54.143
So I think I'm gonna pick that one.

00:03:56.870 --> 00:03:58.270
I got Dylan Sprouse!

00:03:58.270 --> 00:04:01.470
You're the older wiser, and
dare I say more dashing twin.

00:04:01.470 --> 00:04:03.050
Ooh, stop.

00:04:03.050 --> 00:04:04.650
You're mellow and a bit mysterious

00:04:04.650 --> 00:04:07.670
but that just draws people
closer, closer into your orbit.

00:04:07.670 --> 00:04:08.503
Wow, okay.

00:04:08.503 --> 00:04:10.280
I gotta say that was a really nice

00:04:10.280 --> 00:04:11.530
little blurb at the end there.

00:04:11.530 --> 00:04:13.260
I think you're giving me
a little too much credit

00:04:13.260 --> 00:04:16.710
but I'll take it, I guess on
the inside I am actually Dylan.

00:04:16.710 --> 00:04:18.131
What a lovely quiz.

00:04:18.131 --> 00:04:20.798
(upbeat music)

